&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A leadership mentality with an excitement to roll up your sleeves and work alongside your team;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
