&lt;p&gt;With offices on three continents, our team is as global as our client base and we’re excited to continue building a product and service they love. With revenue growing at breakneck speed, we’re looking for a consultative and tenacious&lt;strong&gt; Sales Development Representative - New Grad &lt;/strong&gt;to join our growing Sales Team based out of our Chicago Office!&lt;/p&gt;
