&lt;li&gt;6+ years of product management experience &lt;span class=&quot;citation-5269 citation-5270 citation-5271 citation-5272 citation-5273 citation-5274 citation-5275 citation-5276 citation-end-5276&quot;&gt;(or equivalent domain background in engineering,&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript embedded&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;25&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5269 citation-5270 citation-5271 citation-5272 citation-5273 citation-5274 citation-5275 citation-end-5275&quot;&gt; operations excellence, or analytics transitioning into product)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5269 citation-5270 citation-5271 citation-5272 citation-5273 citation-5274 citation-5275 citation-end-5275&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5262 citation-5263 citation-5264 citation-5265 citation-5266 citation-5267 citation-5268 citation-end-5268&quot;&gt;Background solving complex logistics, physical operational, or system root-cause problems using algorithmic planning, data&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript embedded&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;33&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5262 citation-5263 citation-5264 citation-5265 citation-5266 citation-5267 citation-end-5267&quot;&gt; analysis, and structured logic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead product roadmaps spanning 12 to 18 months working closely with an engineering team and cross-functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and quantitative skills. You are comfortable working with complex datasets, building metrics frameworks, and using data to make decisions. SQL proficiency required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shipping intuitive UX in data-dense, complex domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building user-facing or operator-facing features that simplify multi-step workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate deeply with designers, engineers, and commercial or operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, especially around tradeoffs and prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with B2B workflow software, supply chain platforms, or logistics technology is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
