&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Okta Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep, hands-on mastery of Okta configuration, policy creation, and application integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Protocols:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong knowledge of IAM standards including &lt;strong&gt;SAML, SCIM, OAuth, OIDC, IGA, RBAC,&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;LDAP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with scripting (e.g., Python, Bash, or PowerShell) and &lt;strong&gt;Okta Workflows&lt;/strong&gt; to automate IT tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS &amp;amp; Endpoint Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record managing Google Workspace, Slack, Jira, Jamf (macOS), and Intune (Windows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, a related field, or equivalent practical engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A &quot;compliance-first&quot; attitude to navigate the rigorous requirements of a heavily regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
